Manage connection service dependencies for an agent.

Usage
  azd ai agent connection [command]

Available Commands
  add : Add a connection service dependency to an agent service.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for connection
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
  Attach an existing connection service to an agent
    azd ai agent connection add <service> --agent <agent-service>

Use azd ai agent connection [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
